      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Arx Mentis [zone=1022]\n**Who:**\n- a noctis viratum [ _Quests, Heroic Adventure_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Portal Key Attuner [item=121500]\n- Praetor's Attuned Portal Key [item=121477]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a praetor ledalus [npc=48296]\n- a praetor noctis [npc=48298]\n- a tired praetor ledalus [npc=48307]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Arx Mentis #2: What Lies Above [quest=7801]\n- Arx Mentis #2a: Research and Development [quest=7803]\n- Arx Mentis #2b: The Hands of Rebirth [quest=7804]\n- Arx Mentis #2c: Where It Hurts [quest=7805]\n- Arx Mentis #3: Delving Deeper [quest=7802]\n- Arx Mentis #3a: An Immaterial World [quest=7806]\n- Arx Mentis #3b: Civilized Society [quest=7807]\n- Arx Mentis #3c: The Hands of Destruction [quest=7808]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 04:08:00 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task is part of a series and begins with a noctis viratum ( **click for map image**) at the zone-in of Arx Mentis._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 95\n_Say \"citadel\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, a noctis viratum'\na noctis viratum makes a beckoning motion, quietly, urging you to come closer without attracting any attention. His speaks in a hurried whisper, 'Don't let the praetor see you! They've been attacking foreigners on sight. The citizens are a bit more lenient, at least for now. If you intend to get anywhere here, you're going to need to access the [citadel].'\nYou say, 'The citadel?'\na noctis viratum continues his hurried whisper, 'That pyramid across the way is the junction between the city and the citadel. Every movement within the citadel is tracked, so I suggest you keep your guard up if you manage to survive the trip up.' The shadowy figure begins to detail the logistics of his plan...\nYou have been assigned the task 'Key to the Citadel'.\nThe shady figure hiding in the streets of the city is skeptical of your intentions but seems willing to work with you. Your first order of business will be attuning yourself to the Citadel portal.\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\n'Obtain' a key from a praetor 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ 'Obtain' an attuned portal key from one of the praetor. It is unlikely they will part with their key willingly...\n_Kill any NPC with \"praetor\" in its name to receive a \"Praetor's Attuned Portal Key\" on your cursor. Note that one of these mobs in the zone-in area is a named PH, so watch what you pull!_\n\n---\n\nMake your way to the Penutarx Junction 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ The citadel is divided into four accessible floors. When entering the citadel from the city you will be on the Protarx. Below the Protarx is the Teritarx that is off limits to any lower-ranking praetor. Going up the citadel sequentially from the Protarx are the Anetarx and Penutarx. Travel to the east end of the Penutarx to find the power junction that feeds energy to the inaccessible Apitarx.\n_This updates around /loc -35, -140, 175._\n\n---\n\nKill 3 Penutarx Junction workers 0/3 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ Eliminate some of the workers in the power junction.\n_Kill any three mobs in this room (any mobs count: humanoids and otherwise)._\n\n---\n\nGrab the Key Attuner from the Arx Junction 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\n_\"Portal Key Attuner\" is a ground spawn at /loc 20, -190, 176 (This is a steaming clockwork-looking object sitting on the northeastern table in this room)._\n\n---\n\nGive the Attuned Portal Key to the noctis viratum 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\nGive the Key Attuner to the noctis viratum 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\n\n---\n\nSpeak with the noctis viratum 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ Speak with the shady figure to have him re-attune the portal key to your body.\nYou say, 'Hail, a noctis viratum'\na noctis viratum fiddles with the key attuning device for a moment before pointing it directly at you. You feel your chest heat up as the device emits a brief beam of blue light. The figure nods, 'You've done well. Perhaps you are ready for more.'\nYou are now attuned to the city's portal to the citadel. Though it seems your work with the shady figure has only just begun...\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n75 platinum\n_You can now use the portal on the pyramid to enter the floating tower without taking damage._\n_Despite getting a lockout timer, this task is not repeatable._",
    },
