help slow whatever plan is happening behind the scenes.\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\nExplore the Anetarx Extraction Lab 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ Travel to the east end of the Anetarx to find the extraction lab. This is where foreign weapons are taken to be analyzed and broken down for reusable parts.\n_Updates around /loc 55, -270, 87 (east room on the second floor)._\nClear the Extraction Lab 0/3 (Arx Mentis)\n_Kill three mobs in this room._\n\n---\n\nExplore the Anetarx Central Study 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ Make your way to the center of the Anetarx to find the central study. This is where the citadel's weaponry is modeled.\n_Updates around /loc 45, 20, 86 (west room on the second floor)._\nClear the Central Study 0/3 (Arx Mentis)\n_Kill any three mobs in this room._\n\n---\n\nExplore the Anetarx Armory 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ Head to the northern end of the Anetarx to find the Armory. This is where basic components are used to create praetor's dangerous weaponry.\n_Updates around /loc 210, -15, 84 (north room on the second floor)._\nClear the Armory 0/3 (Arx Mentis)\n_Kill any three mobs in this room._\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Serphus 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n75 platinum",
