f the primary units on this floor.\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\nExplore the Protarx Infusion Lab 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ Head to the western end of the Protarx to find the arc worker infusion laboratory. This is where the lifeless stone golems are infused with the will of the citadel.\n_Updates at around /loc 75, 170, 6 (western room of the first floor)._\nDisrupt the Infusion Lab workers 0/3 (Arx Mentis)\n_Kill any three mobs in this room._\n\n---\n\nExplore the Protarx Relic Keep 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ At the southern end of the Protarx is a small keep dedicated to the acquisition and study of powerful relics. Relics deemed especially important or powerful are passed along to be stored in the Apitarx.\n_Updates at around /loc -165, -45, 28 (southern room of the first floor)._\nEliminate anyone in the Relic Keep 0/3 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ Disrupt the study of the citadel's plundered artifacts by eliminating a few of the workers in the relic keep.\n_Kill any three mobs in this room._\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Serphus 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n75 platinum",
