      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Arx Mentis [zone=1022]\n**Who:**\n- a noctis viratum [ _Quests, Heroic Adventure_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 03:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Arx Mentis: Shake the Citadel [zone=1035]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Praetor Loricas the Hollow [npc=47686]\n- a bone worker [npc=48648]\n- a chef [npc=48649]\n- a custodian [npc=48650]\n- a fading steel worker [npc=48651]\n- a libre vitala [npc=48652]\n- a mason [npc=48653]\n- a musician [npc=48654]\n- a noctis viratum [npc=48672]\n- a painter [npc=48655]\n- a praetor ledalus [npc=48656]\n- a praetor noctis [npc=48657]\n- a scavenger magicae [npc=48658]\n- a steel worker [npc=48659]\n- a vicarum vitai [npc=48660]\n- a virga vitala [npc=48661]\n- an ambulatory carcass [npc=48662]\n- an arc worker [npc=48663]\n- an artist [npc=48664]\n- an author [npc=48665]\n- an ethicist [npc=48666]\n- an herbalist [npc=48667]\n- an indagator materia [npc=48668]\n- an indagator vitali [npc=48669]\n- an indagatrix materia [npc=48670]\n- an indagatrix vitali [npc=48671]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 04:09:42 2014\nModified: Sat Jun 22 20:34:05 2024 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n**About Heroic Adventures:**\n\\- They use the task system (steps are shown in task window, but steps are only revealed as you get to them).\n\\- Scale in difficulty, loot quality, and mob levels (based on your group's highest level player - as low as 85).\n\\- Tuned for 2-3 players and their mercenaries.\n\\- Nameds can spawn as you progress through the task (you usually have to complete a few steps before this can happen).\n\\- Collection items can drop from mobs in the instances, and ground spawns appear midway through tasks.\n\\- Expected time of completion will vary by your group's makeup (anywhere from 30-90+ minutes).\n\\- There is some variations/randomization in the task steps you'll be assigned as you progress through the task.\n**About Our Documentation of Heroic Adventures**\n\\- We only display task steps we know about.\n\\-\\-\\- If you encounter a step that isn't documented here, please post the details (or email us) and **be sure to indicate which step number it was** so that we can display it in its proper place.\n\n---\n\n_This is a heroic adventure (1-6 players) that begins with a noctis viratum ( **click for map image**) in Arx Mentis._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 85\n\\- Completed \"Key to the Citadel\"\n\\- Completed \"What Lies Above\"\n\\- Completed \"Delving Deeper\"\n\n---\n\n**TASK SUMMARY**\n\\- Say \"stop\" to request the task and \"ready\" to zone in.\n**Step #1:**\nEradicate a few ambulatory carcasses 0/5\n\\-\\-\\- Kill five of these mobs.\nBreak their virga vitalas 0/4\n\\-\\-\\- Kill four of these mobs.\nTear up their libre vitalas 0/4\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update (4 mobs).\n**Step #2:**\nSilence the citadel's arcanists 0/20\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update (20 mobs).\nSilence the citadel's priests 0/15\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update (15 mobs).\n**Step #3:**\nDisrupt the citadel's experiments on the scavenger magicae 0/10\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update (10 mobs)\nBeat some sense into the violent citizens 0/7\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update (seven mobs)\nSubdue a few praetors 0/7\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update (seven mobs)\n**\\- At this point in the task, collectibles spawn in the zone (ground spawns) and a named (or its PH) has a chance to spawn.**\n**Step #4:**\nSpeak to the noctis viratum 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Hail update.\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\n**NAMED MOBS**\n_\"Praetor Loricas the Hollow\" (or its PH, \"a fading steel worker\") spawns in the Anetarx Armory at around /loc 190, -40, 83. Spawn rate for the named is about 30%._\n_Known loot from this named:_\nLevel 105\nPraetor's Claws\nRing of Hollows\nLevel 100\n???\nLevel 95\n???\n\n---\n\n**TASK IN DETAIL**\n========================================================================\nTRIGGERING THE TASK\n========================================================================\nYou say, 'Hail, a noctis viratum'\na noctis viratum says 'It's best that I return to the shadows. It is up to you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, to [stop] what the citadel has set in motion.'\nYou say, 'I'll stop it'\na noctis viratum says 'Very well, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Give the word when you're [ready] to begin.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Shake the Citadel'.\nTsalis Ferin feels that it is in his best interest to lay low, but that does not stop him from offering you a chance to strike the citadel on his behalf.\n========================================================================\nSTEP #1\n========================================================================\nEradicate a few ambulatory carcasses 0/5 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Mob kills until you have five updates._\n=====================\nBreak their virga vitalas 0/4 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Mob kills until you have four updates._\n=====================\nTear up their libre vitalas 0/4 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ The citadel continues to test their arcane powers of animation on stranger and stranger objects. They have most recently given life to the pages of heavy tomes. Hinder their research by eliminating these living books. You'll likely find the libre vitalas in the Antearx Extraction Lab as well as the Antearx Armory, Penuarx Stasis Lab, or the Protarx Relic Keep.\n_If You Get This Step: Mob kills until you have 22 updates._\n========================================================================\nSTEP #2\n========================================================================\nSilence the citadel's arcanists 0/20 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ While traversing the halls of the citadel, do away with any indagators or indagatrixes you come across.\n_If You Get This Step: Mob kills until you have 20 updates._\n=====================\nSilence the citadel's priests 0/15 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ While traversing the halls of the citadel do away with any vicarums you come across.\n_If You Get This Step: Mob kills until you have 15 updates._\nYou can find the priests in the library. Kill any of the A vicarum vitai.\n========================================================================\nSTEP #3\n========================================================================\nDisrupt the citadel's experiments on the scavenger magicae 0/10 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ You should be able to deal a critical blow to the citadel's research efforts by exterminating the scavenger magicaes that are held in the Antearx Magicae Sanctuary.\n_If You Get This Step: Mob kills until you have 10 updates._\n=====================\nBeat some sense into the violent citizens 0/7 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ The normally docile citizens that inhabit the town are becoming increasingly violent toward outsiders. Though it may seem counter-intuitive, beating some sense into the most aggressive citizens should send a message to the remaining population that confronting adventurers is not in their best interests.\n_If You Get This Step: Mob kills until you have seven updates. These are the \"an artist\", \"an ethicist\", \"an author\", \"a chef\" types down by the zone-in area._\n=====================\nSubdue a few praetors 0/7 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says: The normally docile citizens that inhabit the town are becoming increasingly violent towards outsiders._\n_Though it may seem counter-intuitive, beating some sense into the most aggressive should send a message to remaining_\n_population that confronting adventurers is not in their best interests._\n_If You Get This Step: Mob kills until you have seven updates._\n========================================================================\nSTEP #4\n========================================================================\nSpeak to the noctis viratum 0/1 (Arx Mentis)\n_Task Window Says:_ Return to Tsalis Ferin and inform him of your success.\n_If You Get This Step: Hail update for task completion._\n\n---\n\n**TASK REWARDS**\n\\- 191 \"Pieces of Eight\"\n- Piece of Eight [item=120483]\n- Praetor's Claws [item=120521]\n- Ring of Hollows [item=122127]",
